#### Multi-Project Context

When updating specs for a multi-project workspace:

1. Update child project specs if discrepancies were found in cross-service documentation.
2. Update the system-level architecture overview in `{{ $baseDir }}/{{ $specFolder }}/{{ $specIndexName }}` if inter-service communication patterns were found to be inaccurate.
