#### Criteria

- [ ] All discrepancies verified against code
- [ ] Proposed changes presented to developer with before/after
- [ ] Approved corrections written to spec files
- [ ] `{{ $specIndexName }}` updated if domains were added or removed
- [ ] `{{ $changelogName }}` has a dated entry with question, findings, and corrections
- [ ] `{{ $planFileName }}` archived and cleared
